  "limitations": [
    "Two client threads, each with one keep-alive connection, on the client CPU set; the product on two CPUs (two Sibuna workers, GOMAXPROCS=2); loopback HTTP forward auth, no origin or TLS.",
    "Every product thread is pinned to the same CPU set with taskset before the product starts.",
    "Hashcash work matched at 8 zero bits / 2 zero hex digits; same User-Agent and client address.",
    "Proof challenges are issued below the 50/s adaptive baseline so the matched work holds; the bootstrap batches above it measure issuance only, which is difficulty independent.",
